@startuml
!define RECTANGLE class

RECTANGLE "Mobile App" as MobileApp {
  - Camera Capture
  - Exercise Interface
  - Posture Evaluation
  - Plan Recommendation
  - Poster & Report Generation
  - Screen Casting
  - User Management
}

RECTANGLE "Server" as Server {
  - Plan Processing
  - Data Analysis
  - Report Generation
  - User Data Storage
}

RECTANGLE "Database" as Database {
  - User Information
  - Exercise Plans
  - Training Records
  - Standard Movements
}

RECTANGLE "Android Devices (LAN)" as AndroidDevices {
  - Screen Casting Receiver
  - Real-time Display
}

MobileApp --> Server : API Calls\n(Plan Recommendation,\nReport Generation)
MobileApp --> Database : Data Access\n(User Info, Plans,\nHistory)
Server --> Database : Data Read/Write
MobileApp <--> AndroidDevices : Screen Casting\n(Real-time Video Stream)

note right of MobileApp
  Key Capabilities:
  - Pose Estimation
  - Real-time Feedback
  - Custom Training Plans
  - Social Sharing
end note

note right of Server
  Key Functions:
  - Intelligent Recommendations
  - Data Processing
  - Report Generation
  - User Analytics
end note

note right of Database
  Data Types:
  - User Profiles
  - Exercise History
  - Training Plans
  - Movement Standards
  - Biometric Data
end note

note right of AndroidDevices
  Casting Features:
  - LAN Discovery
  - Real-time Streaming
  - Low-latency Control
end note

rectangle "External Systems" as External {
  - Authentication Services
  - Cloud Backup
  - Analytics Platforms
}

Server ..> External : Optional Integration

title Indoor Fitness App - System Architecture

legend bottom
  Core Components and Data Flow for Pose-based Fitness Training
end legend
@enduml
